::Q001::[markdown]ὅπλον, ὅπλου, ὁ:{
	~%-100%rogue#Incorrect. **κλέπτης, κλέπτου, ὁ** means “rogue” (Chapter 7).
	~%-100%island#Incorrect. **νῆσος, νήσου, ἡ** means “island” (Chapter 1).
	~%100%shield#Correct: **ὅπλον, ὅπλου, ὁ** → “shield” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%father#Incorrect. **πατήρ, πατρός, ὁ** means “father” (Chapter 10).
	~%-100%day#Incorrect. **ἡμέρα, ἡμέρας, ἡ** means “day” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%woman#Incorrect. **γυνή, γυναικός, ἡ** means “woman” (Chapter 11).
	~%-100%Demothenes (ῥήτωρ)#Incorrect. **Δημοσθένης, Δημοσθένους, ὁ** means “Demothenes (ῥήτωρ)” (Chapter 10).
	~%-100%goat#Incorrect. **αἴξ, αἰγός, ὁ or ἡ** means “goat” (Chapter 6).
}


::Q002::[markdown]long ago:{
	~%-100%ἅτε; οἷα#Incorrect. **ἅτε; οἷα** means “in as much as” (Chapter 8).
	~%-100%μήτε… μήτε; οὔτε… οὔτε#Incorrect. **μήτε… μήτε; οὔτε… οὔτε** means “neither… nor” (Chapter 8).
	~%-100%ὡς#Incorrect. **ὡς** means “in order that” (Chapter 8).
	~%-100%δή#Incorrect. **δή** means “in fact” (Chapter 3).
	~%-100%δέ#Incorrect. **δέ** means “but” (Chapter 2).
	~%-100%τοι#Incorrect. **τοι** means “you know” (Chapter 6).
	~%100%πάλαι#Correct: **πάλαι** → “long ago” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%ὅταν#Incorrect. **ὅταν** means “when” (Chapter 11).
}


